Source: dct-os-desktop
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: DCT IT Services <it@dct.edu.ph>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: dct-os-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: dct-os-defaults (>= 1.0),
         fonts-inter,
         fonts-jetbrains-mono,
         libreoffice-writer,
         libreoffice-calc,
         libreoffice-impress,
         libreoffice-gnome,
         firefox,
         nemo,
         evince,
         timeshift,
         epoptes-client
Recommends: onlyoffice-desktopeditors,
            winetricks,
            calamares
# NOTE: the desktop itself is selected by the image build: the ISO remaster
# starts from Ubuntu Cinnamon, while clean live-build explicitly installs
# ubuntucinnamon-desktop-minimal. Keeping that selection out of this app
# metapackage avoids silently replacing the display manager on other hosts.
Suggests: winehq-stable
Description: Dominican OS desktop environment
 Meta package that turns an Ubuntu Cinnamon 24.04 LTS base into the standard
 Dominican OS classroom desktop: the college's application set, icon/theme
 baseline and classroom management tooling, in one installable unit.
 .
 This is an internally deployed institutional image, not a public
 distribution.
